WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a wide stance, turn the right foot out 90° and bend the right knee over the ankle.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lower the right forearm to the thigh or the right hand to the floor outside the foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Sweep the left arm up and over the ear, palm facing down.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Turn the chest toward the ceiling, feeling one long line from back heel to top hand.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Gaze past the top arm, hold, then switch sides.
